OL,3,GNEWSABudget plan to boost St Helier's  
OL,4,A'economic engine'                      
OL,6,FA new partnership to support town      
OL,7,Fcentre businesses and coordinate events
OL,8,Fand improvements would make Jersey's   
OL,9,Fcapital a "welcoming and accessible    
OL,10,Fplace", according to a States amendment
OL,11,Freport.                                
OL,13,FThe amendment to the budget, lodged by 
OL,14,FDeputy Inna Gardiner, Connetable of St 
OL,15,FHelier, is due to be debated in        
OL,16,FDecember.                              
