OL,3,GNEWSABudget plan to boost St Helier's  
OL,4,A'economic engine'                      
OL,6,FLed by the parish and government, the  
OL,7,FSt Helier Town Partnership would bring 
OL,8,Ftogether businesses, tourism and arts  
OL,9,Foutfits to form a strategy for the     
OL,10,Ffuture of the town centre, the report  
OL,11,Fsaid.                                  
OL,13,FThe partnership would "assess a        
OL,14,Fsustainable longer-term model" which   
OL,15,Fcould then "inform" the budget for     
OL,16,F2028-30, it added.                     
